message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "datp-cp: Calibration-Channel Poisoning of Federated Threshold Personalization"
abstract: >
  Empirical study of calibration-channel poisoning in federated IoT malware detection.
  Evaluates three threshold policies (GLOBAL_THRESHOLD, LOCAL_THRESHOLD, CLUSTER_THRESHOLD)
  under the REPLACE_FIXED_BUDGET injection rule on the N-BaIoT dataset.
  Training data, model weights, aggregation, test scores, and test labels remain clean.
authors:
  - name: "DATP Project"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-22"
